  "description": "For many Hindu families, Sri Lanka is Lanka of the Ramayana. This journey visits the places tradition links to the epic: where Rama worshipped Shiva after the war, the gardens where Sita was held captive, the spot of her trial by fire, and the caves and waterfalls of Ravana’s kingdom.\n\nA Vedic scholar joins us at the main temples to explain the rituals and the stories, while I take care of timings, offerings and the comfort of every generation travelling with you.",
